COHPstartEnergy -20
COHPendEnergy    15
basisSet pbeVaspFit2015
basisFunctions Na 2p 3s
basisFunctions P  3s 3p
basisFunctions Sb 5s 5p
basisFunctions S  3s 3p
basisFunctions Se 4s 4p
saveProjectionToFile
writeBasisFunctions
cohpGenerator from 1.8 to 2.4 type P  type S orbitalWise
cohpGenerator from 2.2 to 2.7 type Sb type S orbitalWise
cohpGenerator from 2.4 to 3.6 type Na type S orbitalWise 
cohpGenerator from 2.0 to 2.4 type P  type Se orbitalWise 
cohpGenerator from 2.4 to 2.7 type Sb type Se orbitalWise
cohpGenerator from 2.6 to 3.7 type Na type Se orbitalWise

cohpBetween atom 1 atom 3 cell 0 -1 -1 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 1 atom 4 cell -1 0 -1 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 2 atom 3 cell 1 0 -1 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 2 atom 4 cell 0 1 -1 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 1 atom 2 cell -1 -1 0 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 3 atom 4 cell -1 1 0 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 5 atom 7 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 5 atom 8 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 6 atom 7 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 6 atom 8 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 5 atom 6 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 7 atom 8 orbitalWise

cohpBetween atom 1 atom 5 cell 0 -1 0 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 2 atom 6 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 1 atom 5 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 2 atom 6 cell 0 1 0 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 3 atom 8 cell -1 0 0 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 3 atom 8 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 4 atom 7 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 4 atom 7 cell 1 0 0 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 1 atom 7 cell 0 0 -1 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 1 atom 7 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 2 atom 8 cell 0 0 -1 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 2 atom 8 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 3 atom 5 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 3 atom 5 cell 0 0 1 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 4 atom 6 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 4 atom 6 cell 0 0 1 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 1 atom 6 cell -1 0 0 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 1 atom 6 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 2 atom 5 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 2 atom 5 cell 1 0 0 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 4 atom 8 cell 0 -1 0 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 4 atom 8 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 3 atom 7 orbitalWise
cohpBetween atom 3 atom 7 cell 0 1 0 orbitalWise
